    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/09/08/4",
    "published": "2026-09-08T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"You must be new here! ... That's Miss Crutchfield, and she's there to make sure nobody runs with scissors.\""
  },
